&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;img style="max-width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cognite.com/en/resources/blog/key-highlights-from-impact-2025"&gt;Impact 2025&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.cognite.com/en/company/newsroom/cognite-s-industrial-ai-momentum-soars-driving-ecosystem-impact-at-global-conference"&gt;Cognite's Industrial AI: Moonshot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We’re globally recognized domain experts with an international presence that spans Phoenix, Houston, Oslo Tokyo, Bengaluru, and Abu Dhabi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cognite is committed to creating a diverse and inclusive environment at work and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive the same level of consideration for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

